@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam TitleFontSize 24
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F66B22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant ModerationService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Submit a report | US-16
Student -> FE: Report student + reason
FE -> API: POST /api/v1/reports\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nSubmitReportRequest { reportedUserId, reason }
API -> S: submitReport(token, reportedUserId, reason)
S -> S: Verify JWT; reporterId = sub (never from body)
alt missing / invalid / expired token
 S --> API: UNAUTHORIZED
 & API --> FE: 401 Unauthorized
else caller SUSPENDED or role != STUDENT
 S --> API: FORBIDDEN
 & API --> FE: 403 Forbidden
else caller authenticated as ACTIVE STUDENT
 S -> DB: SELECT ACTIVE student by reportedUserId;\nSELECT PENDING report (reporterId, reportedUserId)
 DB --> S: Student / none; existing report / none
 alt reported student not found
  S --> API: USER_NOT_FOUND
  & API --> FE: 404 Not Found
 else empty reason or reportedUserId == reporterId
  S --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR; no write
  & API --> FE: 422 Unprocessable Content
 else same reporter already has a PENDING report on this student
  S --> API: DUPLICATE_REPORT (safe POST retry)
  & API --> FE: 409 Conflict
 else database error
  S --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR; nothing saved
  & API --> FE: 500 Internal Server Error
 else valid
  S -> DB: INSERT report (status PENDING, submittedAt = now UTC)
  DB --> S: Report (reportId: UUID)
  S --> API: Report
  API --> FE: 201 Created + Report
 end
end
FE --> Student: Confirmation or error message
note over S,DB: Reporting never changes the reported account's status.
@enduml
